WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 12

01:41.820 --> 01:43.730
You really don't have to check her up!

01:54.940 --> 01:57.050
I told you she's asleep!

02:13.650 --> 02:14.970
Do you want a bite?

02:15.140 --> 02:17.550
Lady Ye, please rest early.

02:17.570 --> 02:18.920
I'm not sleepy yet.

02:19.060 --> 02:20.530
I'll go to sleep after eating.

02:41.780 --> 02:43.370
Where is he?

02:47.730 --> 02:48.890
This...

02:53.490 --> 02:56.530
It's an act out of emergency.

02:58.210 --> 03:00.760
I see. I see.

03:01.140 --> 03:03.330
It's a common plot in the stories.

03:05.980 --> 03:07.760
I'd better wait outside.

03:07.780 --> 03:09.690
Ling'er! Ling...

03:15.450 --> 03:16.820
Ling'er is gone.

03:16.820 --> 03:18.760
Why don't you get up?

03:20.850 --> 03:23.260
I'm tired. I need a few more minutes.

03:23.260 --> 03:24.450
You can't!

03:24.450 --> 03:26.550
Why not?

03:26.570 --> 03:28.630
I'll be condemned for this.

03:28.650 --> 03:30.990
We're engaged.

03:31.010 --> 03:33.090
But we're not married yet.

03:37.980 --> 03:39.690
Get up!

03:41.930 --> 03:43.690
Get up!

03:43.980 --> 03:45.640
Just get up!

03:46.180 --> 03:48.250
I'll leave if you don't get up!

03:55.540 --> 03:56.810
I'm up.

03:57.210 --> 03:58.760
Why are you still here?

03:59.090 --> 04:00.640
I'll leave when you're asleep.

04:10.140 --> 04:11.600
Just leave.

04:11.620 --> 04:13.140
It's bad to be seen.

04:13.140 --> 04:14.960
I'm so lucky.

04:14.980 --> 04:16.920
What?

04:18.770 --> 04:20.760
I fell in love with a girl.

04:21.300 --> 04:23.540
It turns out that

04:23.540 --> 04:26.040
she is my future wife.

04:26.820 --> 04:28.870
The God must have blessed me!

04:28.890 --> 04:30.440
Otherwise, how could I be so lucky?

04:33.490 --> 04:34.210
Rumor has it that

04:34.210 --> 04:36.070
Miss Si Lili from Joy Tsin House

04:36.090 --> 04:37.740
loves you dearly.

04:37.740 --> 04:39.190
I have nothing to do with her.

04:39.210 --> 04:40.170
We are complete strangers.

04:40.170 --> 04:40.910
Really?

04:40.930 --> 04:42.150
Really!

04:42.170 --> 04:44.440
I caused so much trouble

04:44.820 --> 04:46.400
only to cancel the marriage.

04:46.420 --> 04:48.370
Why do you want to cancel the marriage?

04:48.930 --> 04:50.260
Because I'm in love with

04:50.260 --> 04:52.920
a maidservant who steals drumsticks.

04:56.050 --> 04:57.540
Even if you succeed,

04:57.540 --> 04:58.980
Earl Sinan won't allow you

04:58.980 --> 04:59.860
to marry a maidservant.

04:59.860 --> 05:00.930
I don't listen to him.

05:00.930 --> 05:02.800
What about the imperial edict from His Majesty?

05:02.820 --> 05:03.700
Then I'll run away

05:03.700 --> 05:05.750
with her.

05:05.770 --> 05:07.140
If His Majesty leads troops in person

05:07.140 --> 05:08.440
to catch me,

05:08.460 --> 05:10.190
I'll take her out of Nanqing

05:10.210 --> 05:12.630
to the end of the world.

05:12.650 --> 05:14.280
And I'll steal lots of chickens on the way

05:14.300 --> 05:15.970
so that she can eat lots of drumsticks.

05:17.090 --> 05:18.210
How come His Majesty will try to

05:18.210 --> 05:19.890
catch you in person?

05:19.890 --> 05:21.850
You never know.

05:26.930 --> 05:28.560
Is that really your plan?

05:28.580 --> 05:30.040
Yes.

05:30.650 --> 05:32.600
So I've been looking for you all the time.

05:35.770 --> 05:38.200
But I'm sick with tuberculosis.

05:39.580 --> 05:41.050
I can't travel with you

05:41.050 --> 05:43.970
to a faraway land.

05:48.020 --> 05:50.320
When you're cured,

05:50.540 --> 05:52.600
I'll take you out.

05:53.820 --> 05:57.200
I've been sick for years.

05:57.370 --> 05:59.590
Even the imperial physicians couldn't cure me.

05:59.610 --> 06:01.850
That's because they were wrong from the start.

06:02.050 --> 06:04.000
I didn't ask you to eat more meat

06:04.020 --> 06:05.600
randomly.

06:07.020 --> 06:08.680
Treated carefully,

06:08.700 --> 06:10.640
tuberculosis can also be cured.

06:11.460 --> 06:12.970
Believe me.

06:13.020 --> 06:14.760
I will cure you.

06:15.740 --> 06:17.530
I believe you.

06:18.860 --> 06:21.090
Thank you, Doctor Fan.

06:27.140 --> 06:28.960
What did you just call me?

06:28.980 --> 06:30.630
Doctor Fan.

06:30.650 --> 06:32.350
Is that right?

06:32.370 --> 06:34.200
Then what should I call you?

06:37.980 --> 06:40.740
Only after we get married can I call you otherwise.

06:40.740 --> 06:41.370
I just want you

06:41.370 --> 06:42.420
to call me Fan.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.530
Do I have to wait till the marriage?

06:48.140 --> 06:49.300
Can I visit you

06:49.300 --> 06:49.890
regularly?

06:49.890 --> 06:51.130
No.

06:55.020 --> 06:56.350
You know what?

06:56.370 --> 06:58.470
Sometimes, a simple answer as "No"

06:58.490 --> 07:00.720
can ruin one's life.

07:00.980 --> 07:02.920
What do you mean?

07:03.260 --> 07:05.440
Let me tell you a story.

07:05.580 --> 07:06.050
Good!

07:06.050 --> 07:07.420
I love to hear stories the most.

07:07.420 --> 07:08.260
What a coincidence!

07:08.260 --> 07:10.190
I'm really good at telling stories!

07:10.210 --> 07:11.760
Then go ahead.

07:12.980 --> 07:16.370
It was happened

07:16.420 --> 07:19.010
a long, long time ago.

07:19.740 --> 07:22.680
Once upon a time, there was a young man.

07:22.700 --> 07:24.590
He went to school every day.

07:24.610 --> 07:26.850
A young girl from his village

07:27.610 --> 07:29.300
followed him

07:29.300 --> 07:31.970
every day.

07:43.460 --> 07:45.720
But girls are not allowed to go to school.

07:45.740 --> 07:47.540
Well, the rules were not so strict

07:47.540 --> 07:49.410
back then.

07:51.140 --> 07:53.440
Well, go on.

07:53.460 --> 07:57.090
Day by day, she followed him all the time.

08:18.930 --> 08:20.420
Finally, he could tolerate it no more.

08:20.420 --> 08:22.410
He stopped to ask her.

08:23.090 --> 08:24.350
He said...

08:24.370 --> 08:26.090
"Why do you follow me?"

08:26.610 --> 08:28.030
"I follow you

08:28.050 --> 08:30.130
because I like to see you.

08:30.820 --> 08:32.560
I won't bother you.

08:32.580 --> 08:34.210
Isn't that OK?"

08:34.260 --> 08:35.880
What did he say?

08:35.900 --> 08:37.400
He said...

08:37.580 --> 08:39.330
"No!"

08:39.850 --> 08:41.370
After saying that, he turned around and left,

08:41.370 --> 08:42.580
only leaving the young girl

08:42.580 --> 08:43.890
standing there by herself.

08:43.930 --> 08:45.960
Guess what happened later.

08:47.730 --> 08:50.680
She probably

08:50.700 --> 08:52.440
left the village.

08:52.460 --> 08:53.820
Why would she leave?

08:53.820 --> 08:55.510
She was forced

08:55.530 --> 08:57.770
by worldly prejudice.

08:58.410 --> 09:00.390
Though I applaud her for being bold,

09:00.410 --> 09:01.900
I pity her more.

09:01.900 --> 09:03.100
Why is that?

09:03.100 --> 09:06.010
For ordinary families, if a man and a woman fall in love,

09:06.290 --> 09:09.050
a matchmaker should be sent to propose a marriage first.

09:09.050 --> 09:10.800
Then follow the formalities of three letters and six rites.

09:10.820 --> 09:13.080
Later after exchanging the written
marriage proposals, they can get engaged.

09:13.100 --> 09:14.660
Though she acted

09:14.660 --> 09:16.240
out of love,

09:16.260 --> 09:19.080
it shall not be tolerated by worldly ethics and rites.

09:19.100 --> 09:21.800
It was happened a long time ago.

09:21.820 --> 09:23.220
Back then,

09:23.220 --> 09:24.700
the rites were not so strict.

09:24.700 --> 09:26.140
If a man and a woman fell in love,

09:26.140 --> 09:27.290
they could express their feelings face to face.

09:27.290 --> 09:28.660
Which dynasty is that?

09:28.660 --> 09:29.900
Which village can be

09:29.900 --> 09:31.370
so tolerant to women?

09:31.370 --> 09:32.410
How come I don't know?

09:32.410 --> 09:33.640
This is a story.

09:33.660 --> 09:36.080
You can't be so serious about stories.

09:37.610 --> 09:39.080
Well then.

09:39.660 --> 09:42.080
Later after finishing his studies,

09:42.100 --> 09:43.810
he left the village.

09:44.050 --> 09:45.260
But he always

09:45.260 --> 09:46.890
remembered her.

09:47.290 --> 09:48.660
When he returned home

09:48.660 --> 09:50.810
in his seventies,

09:51.260 --> 09:53.690
he wanted to see her again.

09:54.930 --> 09:56.510
Back then,

09:56.530 --> 09:58.470
she was also in her sixties.

09:58.490 --> 10:00.200
She sent a message,

10:00.220 --> 10:03.390
saying, "I know you want to see me,

10:03.410 --> 10:04.960
but,

10:05.100 --> 10:07.080
No!"

10:10.730 --> 10:13.250
So he also sent her a message.

10:13.410 --> 10:15.030
"Tomorrow morning,

10:15.050 --> 10:17.270
I'll wait for you

10:17.290 --> 10:18.020
on the same road to school

10:18.020 --> 10:20.480
with a branch of pink cherry blossoms."

10:21.820 --> 10:24.160
Guess whether she went to see him or not.

10:25.100 --> 10:26.350
I've no idea.

10:26.370 --> 10:27.960
The next morning,

10:28.460 --> 10:30.780
he grabbed one hundred branches of pink cherry blossoms

10:30.780 --> 10:33.050
and waited for her on that road.

10:33.050 --> 10:33.780
Whenever he saw

10:33.780 --> 10:35.440
an old lady passing by,

10:35.460 --> 10:37.400
he would hand out a branch.

10:37.530 --> 10:38.950
Because he knew

10:38.970 --> 10:40.710
the young girl

10:40.730 --> 10:42.150
followed him

10:42.170 --> 10:43.530
back then

10:43.530 --> 10:45.280
was definitely among them.

11:22.490 --> 11:23.800
Sometimes,

11:23.820 --> 11:25.760
a simple "No"

11:25.780 --> 11:28.560
would ruin one's whole life.

11:28.580 --> 11:30.440
So never, never

11:30.460 --> 11:31.820
say that word out

11:31.820 --> 11:34.010
easily!

11:35.820 --> 11:37.080
Are you moved?

11:42.970 --> 11:45.040
Did he ever get married?

11:45.260 --> 11:47.330
Yes, he did.

11:47.530 --> 11:49.460
But he just couldn't forget her.

11:49.460 --> 11:50.410
If so,

11:50.410 --> 11:51.100
why did he

11:51.100 --> 11:52.410
marry another woman?

11:52.410 --> 11:54.020
Why didn't he try to find her

11:54.020 --> 11:54.970
when they were still young?

11:54.970 --> 11:55.700
Well...

11:55.700 --> 11:56.970
He was married

11:56.970 --> 11:58.050
and lived his life.

11:58.050 --> 11:59.170
But he went back

11:59.170 --> 12:00.290
to find her

12:00.290 --> 12:01.140
at such an old age.

12:01.140 --> 12:02.240
Why is that?

12:02.260 --> 12:03.220
He just didn't want to

12:03.220 --> 12:04.820
have regrets.

12:04.820 --> 12:05.780
But had he ever

12:05.780 --> 12:06.780
thought about her?

12:06.780 --> 12:08.580
What if she was also married?

12:08.580 --> 12:09.660
How would her family

12:09.660 --> 12:11.570
take this?

12:13.020 --> 12:14.020
Well, there weren't

12:14.020 --> 12:15.140
so many rules and rites

12:15.140 --> 12:17.020
when the story

12:17.020 --> 12:17.730
happened.

12:17.730 --> 12:19.050
And she didn't have

12:19.050 --> 12:19.730
many family members.

12:19.730 --> 12:21.030
Have you gone to school

12:21.050 --> 12:22.680
in Danzhou?

12:22.700 --> 12:23.970
It has nothing to do with me.

12:23.970 --> 12:25.950
I never went to school in Danzhou.

12:25.970 --> 12:27.640
Nor did I know any girl.

12:27.660 --> 12:28.410
Then why did you

12:28.410 --> 12:30.250
tell me the story?

12:31.260 --> 12:32.220
I just want to

12:32.220 --> 12:33.700
criticize the man with you.

12:33.700 --> 12:35.130
Criticize him!

12:39.140 --> 12:41.350
It really has nothing to do with me.

12:41.370 --> 12:42.220
Just give me

12:42.220 --> 12:43.050
another chance.

12:43.050 --> 12:43.970
I'll tell you

12:43.970 --> 12:44.910
another story.

12:44.930 --> 12:46.840
I know a lot of stories.

12:47.220 --> 12:47.850
I...

12:47.850 --> 12:49.600
I'll tell you the story of the prince and the princess.

12:49.900 --> 12:50.530
I'll tell you the story of

12:50.530 --> 12:52.350
the monk and the monkey.

12:52.370 --> 12:54.250
Or the story of the beauty and the beast.

12:59.930 --> 13:03.330
I remember you are the author of the Red Mansions.

13:05.290 --> 13:08.350
Actually it was written by Mr. Cao.

13:08.370 --> 13:10.210
I'm just retelling the story.

13:10.610 --> 13:12.120
Just tell me the unfinished part of

13:12.140 --> 13:14.810
the Red Mansions.

13:17.290 --> 13:19.160
Does it mean

13:20.050 --> 13:21.050
I can visit you

13:21.050 --> 13:23.080
every day?

13:25.970 --> 13:28.690
I'm sleepy. I'm going to sleep.

13:32.370 --> 13:34.480
Luckily, it's you.

13:36.140 --> 13:37.720
I mean,

13:37.970 --> 13:39.470
luckily, you are

13:39.490 --> 13:41.210
my future wife.

13:43.580 --> 13:45.200
In future, besides the Red Mansions,

13:45.220 --> 13:46.730
I'll tell you many other

13:46.730 --> 13:48.080
interesting stories.

13:48.660 --> 13:51.890
Now, just listen to the doctor

13:52.260 --> 13:53.890
and have a good dream.

14:20.780 --> 14:23.210
Luckily, it's you.

14:45.170 --> 14:47.690
How long will they talk?

16:23.930 --> 16:25.840
Be careful not to catch a cold.

16:28.140 --> 16:30.040
I feel warm inside.

16:32.700 --> 16:34.260
You've caught a cold!

16:34.260 --> 16:35.690
Whose fault is it?

16:35.780 --> 16:37.810
You didn't call me when he's gone.

16:39.900 --> 16:42.080
I fell asleep.

16:43.970 --> 16:45.650
Wanqiu.

16:45.820 --> 16:46.910
My Lady.

16:46.930 --> 16:47.930
Ling'er has caught a cold.

16:47.930 --> 16:49.320
Fetch her some medicine.

16:49.340 --> 16:50.890
Yes.

16:51.820 --> 16:53.150
I'm fine.

16:53.170 --> 16:54.260
After finishing breakfast with you,

16:54.260 --> 16:55.320
I'll go to the Fan mansion.

16:55.340 --> 16:56.220
What for?

16:56.220 --> 16:57.350
To challenge Fan Xian, of course!

16:57.370 --> 16:58.900
Now that you've got someone in your heart,

16:58.900 --> 17:00.260
I certainly have to give him a good beat

17:00.260 --> 17:01.270
so that he can cancel the marriage contract himself.

17:01.290 --> 17:03.040
He is Fan Xian.

17:03.290 --> 17:04.100
Who?

17:04.100 --> 17:05.440
He!

17:05.460 --> 17:06.630
He...

17:06.650 --> 17:08.480
Right!

17:09.860 --> 17:12.130
Why did he pretend to be a doctor?

17:13.010 --> 17:15.130
It's complicated.

17:16.010 --> 17:18.230
He didn't know I am me.

17:18.250 --> 17:23.680
He didn't know you are you?

17:24.410 --> 17:26.170
It's really complicated.

17:26.340 --> 17:27.560
Wait a moment!

17:27.580 --> 17:29.010
What about his improper relationship

17:29.010 --> 17:30.080
with Si Lili?

17:30.100 --> 17:31.990
He said it's not true.

17:32.010 --> 17:34.150
You really believe that?

17:34.170 --> 17:35.630
Where are you going?

17:35.650 --> 17:37.030
To find Si Lili.

17:37.050 --> 17:38.080
Figure out

17:38.100 --> 17:40.480
her relationship with Fan Xian for you.

17:55.770 --> 18:02.200
Hold your hand, and age with you.

18:07.050 --> 18:08.650
How come you're back?

18:09.130 --> 18:10.480
Princess,

18:10.500 --> 18:12.370
Her Highness wants to see you.

18:14.340 --> 18:16.200
Her Highness...

18:18.980 --> 18:20.410
Lady Ling'er.

18:20.620 --> 18:22.110
This is the medicine

18:22.130 --> 18:23.410
My Lady ordered for you just now.

18:23.410 --> 18:24.630
Please drink it before you leave.

18:24.650 --> 18:26.010
Take these medical packages, too.

18:26.010 --> 18:27.130
Take the medicine for another two days.

18:27.130 --> 18:29.440
You'll be cured completely.

18:35.500 --> 18:37.530
All right. See you.

19:06.410 --> 19:07.800
Mother!

19:07.820 --> 19:09.270
Come on!

19:09.290 --> 19:11.290
Take a seat.

19:13.410 --> 19:14.930
Yes.

19:20.460 --> 19:22.370
Allow me.

19:24.650 --> 19:26.480
I heard you've seen a doctor.

19:26.500 --> 19:28.680
Do you feel better?

19:30.220 --> 19:31.910
His treating method

19:31.930 --> 19:33.800
is somewhat special.

19:33.820 --> 19:36.290
I must have a try.

19:36.930 --> 19:39.680
It's always good to have a new method.

19:40.460 --> 19:41.820
I ask you over

19:41.820 --> 19:43.930
to tell you another piece of good news.

19:43.930 --> 19:45.150
Good news?

19:45.170 --> 19:47.250
Your marriage with Fan Xian

19:47.250 --> 19:49.770
might be cancelled soon.

19:51.770 --> 19:53.290
Isn't it an order from His Majesty?

19:53.290 --> 19:54.800
After all, it's not in the written form.

19:54.820 --> 19:56.290
There's still room for discussion.

19:56.290 --> 19:57.870
Also, Chengze

19:57.890 --> 19:59.080
also heard of it

19:59.100 --> 20:01.050
somehow.

20:01.460 --> 20:03.080
He's trying to cancel the marriage for you.

20:03.100 --> 20:04.960
Plus your unwillingness to marry him,

20:04.980 --> 20:06.960
It's likely to be cancelled.

20:07.580 --> 20:09.130
Actually...

20:09.530 --> 20:12.010
Actually, there's no rush.

20:16.820 --> 20:21.360
Last time, you said yourself that

20:21.380 --> 20:23.680
the marriage must be canceled, right?

20:26.220 --> 20:29.110
There are misunderstandings after all.

20:29.130 --> 20:30.650
Misunderstandings?

20:31.820 --> 20:33.600
If there were misunderstandings,

20:33.930 --> 20:35.770
when did you address them?

20:38.580 --> 20:39.530
Is there any misunderstanding

20:39.530 --> 20:40.380
between us?

20:40.380 --> 20:42.080
I don't think so.

20:43.820 --> 20:45.530
Do you believe me now?

20:47.010 --> 20:48.990
I fell in love with a girl.

20:49.010 --> 20:50.580
It turns out that

20:50.580 --> 20:52.560
she is my future wife.

20:52.580 --> 20:54.030
The God must have blessed me!

20:54.050 --> 20:55.960
Otherwise, how could I be so lucky?

21:07.340 --> 21:09.480
You've met Fan Xian?

21:13.650 --> 21:17.770
How did you meet?

21:18.010 --> 21:20.170
Mother, you're thinking too much!

21:20.170 --> 21:21.720
You have feelings for him?

21:21.740 --> 21:23.560
How can that be!

21:24.290 --> 21:26.050
You'd better not.

21:30.530 --> 21:32.840
Do you still want to cancel the marriage?

21:33.460 --> 21:37.600
Just let it be for now.

21:42.290 --> 21:44.370
Judged from your words,

21:44.770 --> 21:47.080
you must like him.

21:47.100 --> 21:48.840
As a mother, I will not

21:48.860 --> 21:50.890
go against your wills.

21:51.050 --> 21:53.370
How would I like him?

21:54.770 --> 21:56.770
You can't be too tired.

21:57.620 --> 22:00.600
We should discuss about it later.

22:03.580 --> 22:05.770
Escort the princess back home.

22:10.380 --> 22:12.050
Yes.

22:27.130 --> 22:29.410
She likes him already.

22:31.100 --> 22:32.650
How fast!

23:11.530 --> 23:13.050
Take a bite?

23:14.930 --> 23:16.200
No!

23:16.220 --> 23:17.930
Stop pulling a long face all day long.

23:17.930 --> 23:19.170
Smile!

23:19.980 --> 23:21.530
I don't make money by smiling.

23:21.820 --> 23:24.170
I won't pay you even if you smile.

23:24.290 --> 23:25.930
Fan.

23:27.130 --> 23:28.680
Li.

23:28.700 --> 23:30.200
-Li? -How are you?

23:30.220 --> 23:31.150
Li?

23:31.170 --> 23:33.290
It sounds close.

23:34.410 --> 23:35.460
What's up?

23:35.460 --> 23:36.740
The Second Prince would like to see you.

23:36.740 --> 23:37.290
When?

23:37.290 --> 23:38.360
How about tomorrow.

23:38.380 --> 23:39.230
Where?

23:39.250 --> 23:40.130
Well.

23:40.130 --> 23:41.700
Miss Si Lili's

23:41.700 --> 23:43.320
Joy Tsin House, of course.

24:17.010 --> 24:18.530
She's dead.

24:47.740 --> 24:49.930
You threaten to kill me.

24:49.980 --> 24:51.380
Even if I feel reluctant,

24:51.380 --> 24:52.890
I have no other choice.

24:54.340 --> 24:56.600
That monster is untamed.

24:56.820 --> 24:59.480
He only takes order when seeing the token.

25:00.220 --> 25:02.050
Here you are.

25:15.100 --> 25:17.170
How could it be him?

26:02.130 --> 26:03.720
What are you doing?

26:03.740 --> 26:04.580
The fire is going out. I'm helping.

26:04.580 --> 26:06.650
Put it down! You know nothing!

26:06.650 --> 26:07.650
This is the liquid medicine

26:07.650 --> 26:08.740
I specially made for Wan'er.

26:08.740 --> 26:10.500
It should be simmered with slow fire for 16 hours.

26:10.500 --> 26:11.410
It can remove heat from the lung to relieve cough.

26:11.410 --> 26:13.200
You almost ruined it.

26:15.010 --> 26:16.510
Are you going to see her again?

26:16.530 --> 26:18.170
We're engaged. It's fine.

26:18.170 --> 26:19.440
You're not married after all.

26:19.460 --> 26:20.930
It's improper.

26:20.930 --> 26:22.750
You don't understand.

26:22.770 --> 26:23.650
I don't visit her

26:23.650 --> 26:24.960
as a man,

26:24.980 --> 26:27.370
but as a doctor.

26:27.700 --> 26:29.030
Wan'er has been sick with tuberculosis for years,

26:29.050 --> 26:30.800
so her medicine should be prepared cautiously.

26:30.820 --> 26:32.270
I visit her frequently

26:32.290 --> 26:34.320
in order to cure her disease and save her life.

26:34.340 --> 26:36.340
I am benign and openhearted,

26:36.340 --> 26:37.840
and I have nothing to hide.

26:37.860 --> 26:39.410
Really?

26:39.650 --> 26:41.600
Then why do you wear the black tights?

26:41.620 --> 26:43.500
Why do you always visit her at night?

26:43.500 --> 26:44.930
You're much talkative than before.

26:44.930 --> 26:46.220
He who touches rouge will be stained with red.

26:46.220 --> 26:47.930
You really mean the second part of the sentence, right?

26:51.740 --> 26:53.170
I still find certain things

26:53.580 --> 26:55.010
to be weird.

26:55.010 --> 26:57.270
Visiting a lady at night is weird of course!

26:57.290 --> 26:58.870
I mean what you just said.

26:58.890 --> 27:02.050
He who touches rouge will be stained with red,
and he who touches ink will be stained with black.

27:02.650 --> 27:03.580
What's wrong with it?

27:03.580 --> 27:04.460
Where does it come from?

27:04.460 --> 27:06.080
It was from ancient times.

27:06.100 --> 27:07.050
No one knows the exact time.

27:07.050 --> 27:08.890
It was originally said by Fu Xuan,

27:08.890 --> 27:09.890
the Commandant-escort of the Western Jin Dynasty.

27:09.890 --> 27:11.600
The Western Jin Dynasty?

27:11.820 --> 27:13.480
Which dynasty is that?

27:16.220 --> 27:17.410
Some poems in my memory

27:17.410 --> 27:18.840
are also known

27:19.460 --> 27:21.320
in this world.

27:21.340 --> 27:22.860
Sometimes, I really can't tell

27:22.860 --> 27:24.600
whether my memory goes wrong

27:24.620 --> 27:26.890
or this world is not real.

27:31.820 --> 27:33.930
Why am I telling you this?

28:01.410 --> 28:02.500
What are you doing?

28:02.500 --> 28:03.870
Sprinkle the spices of the sachet.

28:03.890 --> 28:05.220
The sachet should be hung at the waist.

28:05.220 --> 28:07.050
I'm using it differently.

28:07.650 --> 28:08.530
The spices inside the sachet

28:08.530 --> 28:09.290
can be used to make dishes.

28:09.290 --> 28:10.390
I know that.

28:10.410 --> 28:11.770
Normally, the sachet is filled with

28:11.770 --> 28:13.960
angelica root, ligusticum wallichii and rhizoma kaempferiae.

28:13.980 --> 28:15.840
That's an easy one.

28:16.980 --> 28:18.100
So now you smell like

28:18.100 --> 28:19.990
a spiced duck.

28:20.010 --> 28:21.600
You know nothing!

28:21.620 --> 28:23.340
This is no normal sachet.

28:23.340 --> 28:24.930
I made it specially

28:24.930 --> 28:25.580
for Wan'er.

28:25.580 --> 28:26.410
It contains the extracts of

28:26.410 --> 28:28.080
over 80 floral leaves in total.

28:28.100 --> 28:30.130
It smells fresh at first, mellow in the middle,

28:30.130 --> 28:31.600
and lingering at last.

28:31.770 --> 28:33.890
Wan'er must like it.

28:34.250 --> 28:35.930
Such a bumpkin!

28:48.700 --> 28:50.990
Split the goods among yourselves.

28:51.010 --> 28:53.320
Keep your mouth shut, and leave the capital before the dawn.

28:54.410 --> 28:56.050
Why?

28:57.460 --> 28:59.440
I've been caught in big trouble.

28:59.460 --> 29:00.800
If you don't go,

29:00.820 --> 29:02.840
you'll also be involved.

29:03.410 --> 29:05.080
What about you?

29:06.890 --> 29:07.740
The Second Prince

29:07.740 --> 29:09.510
has invited Fan Xian over tomorrow.

29:09.530 --> 29:11.530
I have to stay for another day.

29:25.820 --> 29:26.380
I've sent the servants

29:26.380 --> 29:28.250
to the frontcourt on purpose.

29:28.380 --> 29:30.410
There's no one at the corridor, either.

29:30.860 --> 29:32.930
No need to get in through the window.

29:34.130 --> 29:36.010
I'm used to that.

29:36.100 --> 29:37.890
Are you feeling better?

29:39.890 --> 29:41.720
Much better.

29:47.620 --> 29:49.250
You've eaten spiced duck.

29:50.770 --> 29:52.150
It was eaten

29:52.170 --> 29:54.560
by my guard.

29:56.250 --> 29:58.580
Shall I tell you another story tonight?

29:58.580 --> 29:59.990
You can tell me in the day.

30:00.010 --> 30:01.340
Your residence is managed under strict rules in the day.

30:01.340 --> 30:02.440
I won't be able to get in.

30:02.460 --> 30:03.380
You can write it down

30:03.380 --> 30:04.720
and have it delivered.

30:04.740 --> 30:06.380
I left the window open

30:06.380 --> 30:07.960
and sent the servants away

30:08.460 --> 30:10.410
because I have something to tell you.

30:11.170 --> 30:12.650
I'm listening.

30:12.930 --> 30:14.890
Though surprised,

30:15.620 --> 30:17.720
I feel really happy

30:18.700 --> 30:21.050
to know that you are Fan Xian.

30:23.580 --> 30:25.890
I shouldn't tell you this,

30:26.010 --> 30:27.560
but I want you

30:27.580 --> 30:28.750
to know

30:28.770 --> 30:30.440
how I feel.

30:30.460 --> 30:32.030
So do I.

30:32.050 --> 30:33.980
I'm also happy to see you.

30:33.980 --> 30:34.910
However,

30:34.930 --> 30:36.230
if you love a girl,

30:36.250 --> 30:38.150
you should respect her first.

30:38.170 --> 30:39.740
You sneak into my room through the window every night.

30:39.740 --> 30:40.770
Are you dallying with me?

30:40.770 --> 30:41.530
We have a long future

30:41.530 --> 30:42.700
ahead.

30:42.700 --> 30:44.050
If you want to tell me stories,

30:44.050 --> 30:46.130
why not wait till we get married?

30:47.130 --> 30:49.650
Actually, I visit you specially at night

30:50.220 --> 30:53.560
not only to tell you stories.

31:06.620 --> 31:08.050
Medicine!

31:31.380 --> 31:32.770
You're back.

31:34.220 --> 31:35.320
It's worn out again.

31:35.340 --> 31:37.440
It's also worn out for climbing tress.

31:38.500 --> 31:40.600
I'll heat the food for you.

31:43.380 --> 31:44.740
Today, I went to see my friend

31:44.740 --> 31:46.860
in the box again.

31:46.860 --> 31:49.290
I also delivered him some food.

31:49.580 --> 31:50.770
Who would live

31:50.770 --> 31:52.010
in a box?

31:52.010 --> 31:54.390
There really is. I've seen one with my own eyes.

31:54.410 --> 31:55.980
He plays with the wooden horse you made

31:55.980 --> 31:57.170
right when he gets back.

31:57.170 --> 31:58.840
And he refuses to get off.

32:00.170 --> 32:02.010
I'm glad he likes it.

32:02.250 --> 32:03.410
Run!

32:05.380 --> 32:06.530
It's so late.

32:06.530 --> 32:07.720
Get off it now.

32:07.740 --> 32:09.480
Wash up and go to bed.

32:14.290 --> 32:15.250
If you don't get off,

32:15.250 --> 32:16.580
I'll throw it away.

32:16.580 --> 32:17.500
You can't!

32:17.500 --> 32:20.250
Mom, dad made it for me!

32:22.580 --> 32:24.410
Zijing!

32:28.500 --> 32:30.200
Call me again!

32:30.220 --> 32:31.890
Call him again!

32:32.620 --> 32:34.080
Call him again!

32:40.170 --> 32:41.320
Fine!

32:41.340 --> 32:43.030
We've got a long future,

32:43.050 --> 32:44.800
I can wait!

32:53.740 --> 32:55.030
I designed the prescription myself

32:55.050 --> 32:57.080
to relieve the cough.

32:57.860 --> 32:58.700
You know

32:58.700 --> 33:00.370
I learned toxicology with my teacher.

33:00.620 --> 33:01.990
So I'm bold in using medicine.

33:02.010 --> 33:03.220
Some of the medical ingredients

33:03.220 --> 33:04.600
won't be used normally.

33:04.620 --> 33:06.530
If I don't deliver it secretly,

33:06.740 --> 33:08.720
I'm afraid you won't be able to see it.

33:14.250 --> 33:15.650
Why do you drink first?

33:15.650 --> 33:16.770
I'm trying it

33:16.770 --> 33:18.560
to prove it's OK.

33:22.820 --> 33:25.410
No need to try it. I believe you.

33:25.930 --> 33:26.860
It doesn't taste bitter, right?

33:26.860 --> 33:28.100
I made the crystal sugar myself.

33:28.100 --> 33:29.410
And I also added osmanthus fragrans.

33:32.770 --> 33:34.630
This is the sweetest medicine

33:34.650 --> 33:36.100
I've ever had in my entire life.

33:36.100 --> 33:37.800
I'm glad you like it.

33:39.170 --> 33:41.630
It must be time consuming.

33:41.650 --> 33:42.700
The medical ingredients are easy to find.

33:42.700 --> 33:43.770
But I have to watch it

33:43.770 --> 33:44.580
during the decoction.

33:44.580 --> 33:46.080
I must stay focused for hours.

33:46.100 --> 33:47.860
Why didn't you send a maidservant to do that?

33:47.860 --> 33:49.290
It's for you.

33:49.500 --> 33:51.250
I don't trust others.

33:53.620 --> 33:55.840
Then thank you, Doctor Fan!

34:02.770 --> 34:04.170
What's wrong?

34:05.820 --> 34:07.340
I just feel sleepy?

34:07.340 --> 34:10.000
Sleepy? You feel sleepy suddenly?

34:15.450 --> 34:17.580
It's fine. One of the ingredients

34:17.580 --> 34:18.690
might not suit you.

34:18.690 --> 34:19.660
Just like being drunk,

34:19.660 --> 34:21.130
you'll be fine after a good sleep.

34:21.290 --> 34:23.760
I'll change that ingredient later.

34:25.100 --> 34:26.520
Wan'er.

34:27.860 --> 34:29.520
Wan'er.

34:31.010 --> 34:32.800
Wan'er.

34:33.820 --> 34:36.000
I feel so hot!

34:38.140 --> 34:39.930
So hot!

34:42.690 --> 34:44.240
Wan'er.

34:45.100 --> 34:46.180
-I want to go for a blow! -Stop! You might catch a cold!

34:46.180 --> 34:47.930
Stop! Stop!

35:10.050 --> 35:11.690
At last,

35:12.530 --> 35:15.040
the emperor gave up the throne

35:15.820 --> 35:18.490
and never went back.

35:20.140 --> 35:20.940
Because he only wanted to

35:20.940 --> 35:22.970
travel around the world

35:23.730 --> 35:25.840
with the woman he loved.

35:28.690 --> 35:30.320
Wan'er.

35:31.010 --> 35:32.730
Are you listening?

35:36.140 --> 35:38.100
Travel around the world...

35:38.100 --> 35:39.530
I have a secret

35:39.530 --> 35:41.240
to tell you.

35:42.620 --> 35:44.100
Actually,

35:44.100 --> 35:46.650
I'm from another world.

35:49.140 --> 35:51.370
I was about to die,

35:51.770 --> 35:53.750
but when I woke up,

35:53.770 --> 35:54.690
I was here

35:54.690 --> 35:56.560
somehow.

35:57.250 --> 35:58.930
This world

35:59.770 --> 36:01.840
is very different from

36:01.900 --> 36:03.400
the one I remember.

36:03.420 --> 36:04.860
But they are also closely linked

36:04.860 --> 36:06.450
in so many ways.

36:10.940 --> 36:11.820
I've never told my secret

36:11.820 --> 36:13.600
to anyone else.

36:14.450 --> 36:16.280
It's useless even if I tell them.

36:17.180 --> 36:18.840
Who would believe me?

36:22.530 --> 36:23.620
You may find me

36:23.620 --> 36:25.130
laughing and joking all the time,

36:28.860 --> 36:31.170
but I feel especially lonely at heart.

36:32.940 --> 36:34.660
I often wonder

36:34.660 --> 36:36.520
if I'm redundant in this world.

36:37.100 --> 36:39.450
I walk in this world

36:39.530 --> 36:41.370
alone.

36:41.900 --> 36:44.560
I have nothing to tell others.

36:44.690 --> 36:45.660
And I don't care

36:45.660 --> 36:47.450
what others say.

36:48.290 --> 36:49.380
No one around me

36:49.380 --> 36:50.730
can truly

36:50.730 --> 36:52.280
understand me.

36:54.900 --> 36:57.170
Until I met you.

36:58.380 --> 37:01.710
After meeting you,

37:01.730 --> 37:04.040
I found it's meaningful

37:04.380 --> 37:05.250
to stay

37:05.250 --> 37:07.890
in this world.

37:08.380 --> 37:10.030
I stopped wondering

37:10.050 --> 37:12.690
what this world is all about

37:12.730 --> 37:14.760
and who I really am.

37:35.210 --> 37:37.130
Who are you?

39:02.250 --> 39:03.600
Brother.

39:05.900 --> 39:07.510
How about I go with you?

39:07.530 --> 39:09.180
He invited me to a brothel boat.

39:09.180 --> 39:10.840
It's improper for you to go.

39:11.660 --> 39:13.860
I suppose the Second Prince wants to draw you over to his side.

39:13.860 --> 39:14.990
I know.

39:15.010 --> 39:16.640
What's your plan?

39:16.660 --> 39:18.760
Getting involved in their competition for the throne

39:18.860 --> 39:20.800
might bring trouble to the family.

39:20.820 --> 39:22.450
I'd better keep a distance.

39:22.860 --> 39:24.030
Ruoruo,

39:24.050 --> 39:25.620
what if I decide to go back to Danzhou?

39:25.620 --> 39:27.560
Then I'll go with you.

39:28.450 --> 39:30.270
Let me think about it.

39:30.290 --> 39:31.860
Well, just go inside.

39:31.860 --> 39:34.000
Brother, be careful!

39:35.050 --> 39:36.670
Since the trial last time,

39:36.690 --> 39:38.890
the Crown Prince hasn't made a move.

39:39.010 --> 39:40.890
I'm really worried.

39:49.450 --> 39:51.450
This is the capital city.

39:51.660 --> 39:54.280
Can he really kill me on the streets?

39:54.770 --> 39:56.370
Go inside.

39:57.420 --> 39:59.080
To the Joy Tsin House!

40:57.880 --> 41:00.230
=Cheng Jushu, Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master of Beiqi=

41:35.250 --> 41:37.100
I rarely see you smile.

41:37.100 --> 41:38.800
Are you in a good mood today?

41:40.450 --> 41:43.520
My son called me last night.

41:43.770 --> 41:46.080
They must be really important to you.

41:46.970 --> 41:48.470
If there's no one

41:48.490 --> 41:49.210
you're willing to die for

41:49.210 --> 41:50.880
in this world,

41:50.900 --> 41:52.890
how boring it will be!

41:52.940 --> 41:54.240
I understand.

41:54.580 --> 41:55.620
Only with someone like that

41:55.620 --> 41:56.450
can we really

41:56.450 --> 41:58.170
take roots in this world.

41:59.180 --> 42:00.400
I just heard that

42:00.420 --> 42:02.000
you want to go back to Danzhou?

42:02.290 --> 42:04.650
Not until I marry Wan'er.

42:05.580 --> 42:06.050
Will you

42:06.050 --> 42:07.100
go with me?

42:07.100 --> 42:08.560
We could be neighbors.

42:08.580 --> 42:09.890
You are really leaving the capital city?

42:11.490 --> 42:13.170
Before I came here,

42:13.690 --> 42:15.970
I wanted to find out the one who tried to kill me,

42:16.100 --> 42:18.030
to explore the past of my mom,

42:18.050 --> 42:19.660
and to figure out

42:19.660 --> 42:21.080
the secrets of this world.

42:21.380 --> 42:22.600
What now?

42:23.180 --> 42:24.010
I realize that

42:24.010 --> 42:25.560
I'm a lazy man after all.

42:25.690 --> 42:27.320
I just want to live.

42:28.010 --> 42:29.160
As long as my payment

42:29.180 --> 42:30.120
doesn't change,

42:30.140 --> 42:31.470
I can follow you anywhere.

42:31.490 --> 42:33.890
Then you'd better do a good job!

42:34.380 --> 42:35.710
I'm afraid I can't.

42:35.730 --> 42:36.560
I owe this life

42:36.580 --> 42:38.120
to my family.

42:38.140 --> 42:39.160
As to you,

42:39.180 --> 42:39.970
when there's some danger,

42:39.970 --> 42:40.950
you should face it yourself.

42:40.970 --> 42:43.600
I'll run away immediately.

42:44.940 --> 42:46.450
You're really honest.

43:04.050 --> 43:06.760
Fan Xian should be here soon.

43:07.010 --> 43:10.080
Take it easy. I'm early.

43:36.160 --> 43:39.740
In the river of history,

43:39.760 --> 43:43.230
time goes round and round.

43:46.040 --> 43:49.380
Memories about the former and present lives

43:49.400 --> 43:53.470
join each other in an endless way.

43:55.360 --> 43:57.980
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:58.000 --> 44:00.240
one season follows another in a flash,

44:00.240 --> 44:02.740
and the wild geese are flying south.

44:02.760 --> 44:04.360
I just can't give up

44:04.360 --> 44:07.700
to be with you for my whole life.

44:07.720 --> 44:13.190
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:14.440 --> 44:16.990
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:17.280 --> 44:19.320
Year after year in the wandering,

44:19.320 --> 44:21.980
I count the remaining years.

44:22.000 --> 44:24.180
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:24.200 --> 44:26.190
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:26.480 --> 44:28.870
I never feel regretful.

44:28.920 --> 44:30.280
In such a chaotic world,

44:30.280 --> 44:33.260
I still miss you as ever.

44:33.280 --> 44:36.230
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:36.520 --> 44:38.580
With a gentle heart,

44:38.600 --> 44:41.260
I cherish our remaining years.

44:41.280 --> 44:42.800
Even though we have to go through

44:42.800 --> 44:45.310
all the hardships along the journey,

44:45.440 --> 44:52.630
you always stay by my side,

44:52.720 --> 44:55.390
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:55.680 --> 44:57.760
Year after year in the wandering,

44:57.760 --> 45:00.420
I count the remaining years.

45:00.440 --> 45:02.580
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

45:02.600 --> 45:04.830
even though we end up the destiny,

45:05.040 --> 45:07.220
I never feel regretful.

45:07.240 --> 45:08.640
In such a chaotic world,

45:08.640 --> 45:11.700
I still miss you as ever.

45:11.720 --> 45:14.830
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:14.920 --> 45:17.060
With a gentle heart,

45:17.080 --> 45:19.780
I cherish our remaining years.

45:19.800 --> 45:21.240
Even though we have to go through

45:21.240 --> 45:23.900
all the hardships along the journey,

45:23.920 --> 45:32.680
you always stay by my side...
